        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "A simple 7-day program"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Observe your sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Increase your hydration."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Take a thirty-minute walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cut down on sugary products."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Reduce screen time in the evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 6"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Practice ten minutes of calm breathing."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Day 7"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Take stock of the changes you have observed."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "These simple measures are often the starting point for lasting improvement."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Conclusion"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Restoring your energy does not depend on a miracle solution or an instant stimulant. Vitality rests above all on respecting the body's fundamental needs: sleep, diet, physical activity, breathing and emotional balance."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Family Clinic approach offers a comprehensive strategy aimed at gradually restoring the body's natural capacities for recovery and energy production. Every improvement, however modest, helps strengthen health, well-being and quality of life."
    },
